      "message": "docs(site): reference for the turning operations\n\nOne section per turning kind in the registry (Facing, Profile Rough,\nProfile Finish, Groove Rough, Groove Finish, Part, Threading, Chamfer,\nTaper, Multi-Pass, Form, Bore): what it is for, its tabs and seed\ndefaults, the tool it takes and its common refusals, plus the lathe\nconcepts every kind shares (no picks, spindle axis, G96/G97 surface\nspeed and feed per rev, the workholding rpm ceiling, holder checks).\nLinked from the operations page.\n\nRefs #1250\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
